# Files GitHub Pages publishes. Nothing else in this repo is served.
# Line types:  path or glob = published (a * never crosses a /; a glob must
# match a file) · !path = known, deliberately not published · @prefix/ = a
# watched area: every file the routine changes under it must match a line
# above, or the Pages run fails "UNCOVERED".
# The workflow deploys only once Pages is set to GitHub Actions; until then
# every run is a dry run that stages and checks but publishes nothing.
index.html
ksnb-render.js
data/index.json
data/periods/*.json
!data/.last-check
@data/
# Not published: archive/status_*.html, the retired snapshot series (last
# 2026-09-20; nothing links to it). Add `archive/status_*.html` to keep it.
